  "adaptations": [
    "Only the already public 2.0.0 manifests are the baseline; no runtime/library snapshot imports.",
    "Cloud schema matcher is extracted as a pure standalone helper; SDK parsing uses pinned local TypeScript.",
    "Collaboration excludes model gateway and model chat families and their normalized contexts.",
    "Azure DevOps includes public SDK models, timeline and operation paging only; excludes office callback policy, PR controller context and private workflow reports.",
    "Existing public canonical IDs are reused; new generic structural IDs are deterministic. Existing release bytes and definition revisions remain unchanged.",
    "Nullable Text List receives a documented schema and paired codecs; nullable JSON reuses the existing finite JSON vocabulary that already permits null.",
    "Current authoring uses logical asset identity; immutable artifact and definition revision fields remain transport/provenance details."
  ],
